        "date": "2025-11-28T15:59:31Z"
      },
      "message": "Svucrg: Clarify the semantic of PTE.CRW when Svucrg is enabled.\n\nAdd text to make it clear that PTE.CRW=0 does not imply the \"no capability\"\nstate when sstatus.CRGE=1. In particular, future extensions can define one of\nthe PTE.CRW=0 CD=X CRG=X reserved bit combinations to allow capability load and\nstores.",
